summary.label:
Generate random values ​​for various purposes. With this application you can generate uniformly distributed integers, choose random letters, sorting playing cards or even a color. Can be useful whether you are a developer who needs to test values ​​as well as if you want to randomly select something for a board game.

Generated data can be copied, exported or shared.

Features:
- Random Numbers between an interval;
- Random Words from a 130,000 words dictionary;
- Random Letters;
- Random Colors;
- Random Cards (with suit and rank);
- Randomly select an item from a list created by you.
- Random Directions (up/down, left-right, 4-direction, 8-direction options)
- Roll up to 5 Dice;
- Yes or No;
- Head or Tails;
- Rock-paper-scissors;
